{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is found, move, check properties and take. Else, scan area for targets.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckTargetProperty1    /> <Action ID = CheckTargetProperty2    /> <Action ID = CheckTargetProperty3    /> <Action ID = ScanForTargets    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetInRange    />",
